text: ['Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Draw four cards.', 'Draw three cards.', "Incinerate deals 3 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't be regenerated this turn.", 'Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order. You may shuffle.\\nDraw a card.']
